              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "38:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu na anafundzie ariphofika Kaperinaumu, atoza kodi a Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu amlunga Petero achendamuuza, “Avi yuno mwalimu wenu, nkuripha kodi ya Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero achiamba, “Ee, nkuripha.” Phahi Petero ariphoinjira mura nyumbani, kabila kadzangbwegomba neno, Jesu wamuuza, “Simoni, we uonadze? Afalume a dunia nkukusanya maripho au kodi kula kpwa ano ani? Kula kpwa arisi aho hebu kula kpwa anjina?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero achiamba, “Kula kpwa anjina.” Phahi Jesu wamuamba, “Kpwa hivyo arisi taahusika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo nahusiakosere, phiya ziyani ukalowe. Na ngʼonda wa kpwandza ndiyemgbwira, mnahule kanwa, undaona feza. Ihale ukaariphe, kodiyo na yangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
